{
  "entries": [
    {
      "offset": "0x316b3c",
      "back_en": "expected. Everything went well, then, I suppose?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x316b9c",
      "back_en": "They arrived before nightfall after all.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x316df2",
      "back_en": "...Our pursuer, General Vurai... has been\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x316e1e",
      "back_en": "eliminated by my dear brother.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x317000",
      "back_en": "way in all of this around here!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragment; idiom rendered acceptably."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x317338",
      "back_en": "Wh-What happened to Haku?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x317366",
      "back_en": "...He died.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x317553",
      "back_en": "Wha--Hey, Rulutieh! Get a hold of yourself--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3175eb",
      "back_en": "I demand your answer, Oshtor!!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x31776d",
      "back_en": "...\"I'm sorry for breaking our promise in the end.\"",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x31788d",
      "back_en": "What... does it matter now...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Added 'now' but fine."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x31793b",
      "back_en": "I could only stay here... until Haku could learn\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x31796e",
      "back_en": "to live on his own... That was the promise...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x317a0d",
      "back_en": "do you really want to leave it all behind?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x317ab1",
      "back_en": "...Goodbye.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x317ad3",
      "back_en": "I'm here... I'm right in front of you...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x317b02",
      "back_en": "...Maybe I could tell Kuon the truth,\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x317b2f",
      "back_en": "and no one else--\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x317b52",
      "back_en": "No one can know of Oshtor's death.\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x317b77",
      "back_en": "Not even me...",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Source 'Not even Kuon' changed to 'eu' (me); name/meaning altered."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x317b88",
      "back_en": "...Haku...",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Source '...Kuon...' translated as '...Haku...'; wrong name."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x317c62",
      "back_en": "the Akuruka in my hand.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x317ce6",
      "back_en": "everything dear to you/him.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'dear to me' became 'lhe é caro' (dear to you/him); wrong person."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x317cfd",
      "back_en": "For my name is...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x317f58",
      "back_en": "Our great father, the Mikado--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x317f77",
      "back_en": "The god incarnate has passed!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x317fdf",
      "back_en": "The Mikado...? But he can't have...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x31804d",
      "back_en": "heavens, but by dark and vile scheme.\\n",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'malicious plot and dark' truncated with period; 'dark' continuation lost."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3180ff",
      "back_en": "And they dared even to bare their claws at the\\n",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'fangs' rendered as 'garras' (claws); minor lexical shift."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x31815c",
      "back_en": "Highness!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3181c3",
      "back_en": "still lives.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x31822f",
      "back_en": "at her life!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3183f9",
      "back_en": "with Her Highness.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3184d0",
      "back_en": "of Her Highness, I ask the aid of all of you.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate fragment."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x31865f",
      "back_en": "I swear upon the Akuruka bestowed to me by the\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x318690",
      "back_en": "Mikado! In the name of Oshtor, of the Imperial Guard\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3186c2",
      "back_en": "of the Right!!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x316a6c",
      "back_en": "Citizen",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x316f69",
      "back_en": "Indeed. From what I heard, Lord Oshtor\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3170c0",
      "back_en": "But... what about Haku?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Dropped 'Um'/'Sir' but meaning intact."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x317164",
      "back_en": "The audacity of not waking me for something so\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3171c3",
      "back_en": "in him!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragment; acceptable."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3175c9",
      "back_en": "Answer me...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3175d6",
      "back_en": "Answer me, Oshtor...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x317663",
      "back_en": "with enough force to split a tree.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'in half' omitted but minor."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3176d7",
      "back_en": "The metal fan stopped, a hair's breadth from\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3177da",
      "back_en": "\"...Thank you.\"",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3177ea",
      "back_en": "Lord Haku asked me to deliver this message.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x317a94",
      "back_en": "Bosslady, you're going away?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x317df5",
      "back_en": "eyes looking to me for answers. However, I\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x31809d",
      "back_en": "After the Mikado's death, countless seeds of evil\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x318309",
      "back_en": "Mikado!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3183cb",
      "back_en": "I ask that you stand by my side — No...\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3184a1",
      "back_en": "And... that I might return that smile to Her\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3185bc",
      "back_en": "If we act as one, Ennakamuy will never\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x318654",
      "back_en": "Ennakamuy!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    }
